deleteInterval [SimTalk]
Deletes all values located within the designated time interval from the TimeSequence designated by
<Path>.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.deleteInterval([BeginningOfInterval:time, EndOfInterval:time])
Parameters
You can specify the following parameters:
• The optional parameter BeginningOfInterval of data type time designates the beginning of the time
interval.
• The optional parameter EndOfInterval of data type time designates the end of the time interval.
The TimeSequence also deletes entries matching one of the boundaries.
Example
resultList.deleteInterval(0,3600)
deleteInterval [SimTalk]
