multiply [SimTalk]
Multiplies all items of the value column of the TimeSequence designated by <Path> with a numerical
value. In addition, a time sequence may be multiplied with another time sequence.
Remarks
The time column of the result is the union of the time column of both time sequences. The value column
of the result contains the product of the values of both time sequences at the respective times.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.multiply(Factor:any)
Parameter
The parameter Factor of data type any designates the multiplication factor.
Example
MyTimeSequence.multiply(5)
dimx.multiply(dimy)
